WEBVTT

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:07.300
By sending a Meklord Emperor part from my hand to the

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.330
graveyard, Meklord Astro Mekanikle gains that monster's effect.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.710
Mekanikle gains Wisel Attack 5's effect.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:20.310
When it attacks a monster in defense 
position, you take double the piercing damage!

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.760
But I have Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:30.760
It's pointless.  When Wisel Attack 5 
attacks, it negates and destroys your trap card.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.710
What?

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:36.180
Oh no!  He can't use Scrap-Iron 
Scarecrow to stop the attack!

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:37.650
That's not all.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.740
Shooting Star Dragon has 2500 defense points.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:43.710
Meklord Astro Mekanikle 
has 4000 attack points.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:48.420
The difference is 1500 points, so Yusei will 
take double for 3000 points of piercing damage.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:52.810
Well, Yusei Fudo?

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.800
How does despair taste?

00:00:55.730 --> 00:01:00.050
The WRGP Finals is between 
Team 5D's and Team New World!

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:05.410
Yusei Fudo barely kept his ace monster Shooting Star Dragon on

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:09.740
his field, but Aporia's next attack will definitely destroy it!

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:13.580
What will Yusei Fudo do?

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:19.180
I'll win with my next attack, and 
the Circuit will be complete.

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:24.680
When the Circuit is complete, Circuit will emit

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:30.010
infinite energy and guide Ark Cradle to Neo Domino City.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:33.910
Destruction will create a 
new history for humanity.

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:36.910
A new future without despair!

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:45.100
How can I defeat the god of 
despair Meklord Astro Mekanikle?

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.250
Here I go, Yusei Fudo!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.290
You'll form the foundation 
of humanity's new future!

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:56.460
What will you do, Yusei Fudo?

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:57.920
Yusei!

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:02.500
God, please help us!

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.070
Yusei!

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:11.460
Jack!  Crow!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.920
It's Jack and Crow!

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:17.650
Have they healed?

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.310
Yusei, we're going with you!

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.850
We won't let you fight alone!

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.250
No!  Stay back!

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.460
If you get hurt even more, 
you'll never stand again!

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:34.420
So what?  We can't rest while 
you're fighting, Yusei!

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:40.250
Even if it'll destroy my body, the 
three or us will seize the future!

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.640
The three of us...

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.440
That's right.  I still have this card.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:50.420
Jack left me the symbol of our bond.

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:53.530
As long as I have this card, I can't lose!

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.340
Riding Duels.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.480
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:07.270
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:14.940
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:19.310
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:36.390
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:42.030
Set free your infinite potential

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:47.440
Every beginning is up to you

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:53.950
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:59.320
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:05.160
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:12.960
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:18.340
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:23.840
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:29.380
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:36.420
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:56.440
Fierce Battle!
Meklord Astro vs Synchro Monster

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:03.350
Meklord Astro Mekanikle 
attacks Shooting Star Dragon!

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:06.100
The Cube of Despair!

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:10.440
I activate the trap Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.460
It negates your monster's attack!

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.100
That's pointless.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:18.900
Did you forget that trap cards can't 
affect Meklord Astro Mekanikle right now?

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.180
Due to the effect of Wisel Attack 5 that I sent

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:25.630
to the graveyard, your trap is negated and destroyed!

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:28.100
But only one card is destroyed!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.570
That's right!  Use my card!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.680
I activate the trap Revenge Twin Soul!

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.580
When the opponent's monster attacks, by removing

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.120
two Synchro Monsters in your graveyard from play...

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:44.010
...a monster gains defense points equal to the 
removed monsters' total Level multiplied by 100!

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:49.470
I remove Level 12 Red Nova Dragon and Level 8 Black-Winged Dragon

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.870
from play to increase Shooting Star Dragon's defense points by 2000!

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:59.360
It now has more defense points than 
Meklord Astro Mekanikle's attack points!

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:03.070
And when your defense points are greater than his attacking

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:06.800
monster's attack points, Revenge Twin Soul destroys his monster!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.740
We did it!

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.020
Don't underestimate me.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.710
I activate Meklord Astro Mekanikle's effect!

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:18.690
By removing one Meklord Emperor part in my 
graveyard from play, this card isn't destroyed.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.880
I remove Granel Carrier!

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:35.770
Yusei Fudo used the first Wheeler Jack's trap to 
counterattack, but Mekord Astro's effect avoided it!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:40.100
So close!  He almost destroyed Mekanikle!

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:42.390
But he dealt damage!

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:47.340
Please keep it up and win!

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:56.760
That was a nice strategy, 
but it was still pointless.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.790
I know I'm going to win.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:02.250
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.440
Now it's our turn!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.420
My turn!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.780
I activate Speed Spell - Angel Baton!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:16.940
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters, I draw two

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:19.560
cards and then send one card in my hand to the graveyard.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:22.700
Then I activate the trap Dimension Voyage!

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:28.520
I Special Summon as many Synchro Monsters 
that were removed from play as possible!

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:31.750
Two Synchro Monsters were removed from play!

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:32.580
Here we go!

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:37.100
Appear, Red Nova Dragon 
and Black-Winged Dragon!

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:45.370
The Special Summoned monsters lose their effects,

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:48.570
can't attack and are removed from play during the End Phase.

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.660
They have no effects and can't attack?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.550
What are you planning?

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:57.100
I switch Shooting Star 
Dragon to attack position!

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:01.650
Then I activate the Continuous 
Trap Trust Chain!

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:04.590
Synchro Monsters can't attack this turn.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:09.920
Red Nova Dragon and Black-Winged Dragon's attack points are

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.920
added to Shooting Star Dragon's attack points until the End Phase!

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.720
9600 attack points!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.250
Our teamwork worked!

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:23.670
See that, Mr. Despair?  This is our bond!

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:27.130
As long as we have this 
bond, we will never despair!

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:33.480
Even if despair awaits us, our 
bond will open a new future!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.070
9600 attack points versus 4000 attack points.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:40.160
Aporia has 3400 life points left.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:44.320
If this attack succeeds, Yusei Fudo wins!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:51.060
But due to the Continuous Trap Trust Chain's 
effect, Synchro Monsters can't attack.

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:56.690
Since Salvagent's effect resurrected Shooting 
Star Dragon, it's treated as a Normal Monster.

00:08:56.690 --> 00:08:58.040
Therefore, it's not affected.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:02.090
Yusei planned it so that it 
wouldn't be a Synchro Monster.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:03.700
Yusei is incredible!

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:14.240
Shooting Star Dragon attacks 
Meklord Astro Mekanikle!

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:21.300
You still don't understand true despair.

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:24.880
I activate my trap Banishing Climb!

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:28.170
This card can only activate 
during the Battle Phase.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:31.580
It removes all Synchro Monsters 
on the field from play.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.790
Remove Synchro Monsters from play?

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:48.960
Shooting Star Dragon now has fewer attack 
points than Meklord Astro Mekanikle!

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:53.950
I can destroy Trust Chain 
to end the Battle Phase!

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.800
He couldn't destroy it.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.360
The combo didn't work.

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:10.020
Due to Banishing Climb's effect, monsters that were removed from

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:14.770
play return to the field without its effects after the Battle Phase!

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:17.250
What?  Return to the field?

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:28.210
This is bad.  Due to Banishing Climb's effect, Red Nova

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:34.100
Dragon and Black-Winged Dragon don't have Dimension Voyage's effect.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.920
What does that mean?

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:36.800
I see!

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:41.270
Yusei's Dimension Voyage's effect should've only Special

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:45.160
Summoned Red Nova Dragon and Black-Winged Dragon for this turn.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.550
They were supposed to be removed 
from play during the End Phase.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:52.140
But since Aporia's Banishing Climb removed and returned them from

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:58.350
play, Red Nova Dragon and Black-Winged Dragon remain on the field.

00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.530
What does that mean?

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:04.650
Meklord Astro Mekanikle will absorb 
a Synchro Monster next turn.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:06.940
That's really bad!

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:14.120
Red Nova Dragon and Black-Winged 
Dragon will be absorbed.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:17.740
Yusei Fudo, declare the end of your turn.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:21.620
I will teach you true despair!

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:27.120
Meklord Astro Mekanikle will absorb 
a Synchro Monster next turn!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.620
Team 5D's is in huge trouble!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.830
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.280
My turn!

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:42.040
I activate Meklord Astro Mekanikle's effect!

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:49.900
Once per turn, it absorbs a Synchro Monster 
and gains its original attack points!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:52.890
I absorb Red Nova Dragon!

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:01.970
It absorbed Red Nova Dragon!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:09.670
By sending a Meklord Emperor part to the 
graveyard, Meklord Astro Mekanikle gains its effect.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:14.000
By sending Granel Top 5 to the graveyard, it can now

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:19.050
absorb a Synchro Monster on your field once per turn!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.140
He's absorbing both Synchro Monsters?

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.830
Black-Winged Dragon!

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:30.800
Our hopes are gone.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:41.340
Meklord Astro Mekanikle gains the absorbed 
Synchro Monster's original attack points!

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:45.520
10300 attack points?

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:51.480
How's that, Yusei Fudo?  Feel despair and 
become the foundation for the future!

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:02.970
It's truly over, Yusei Fudo.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:06.550
Meklord Astro Mekanikle 
has 10300 attack points.

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:09.000
It's all over with the next attack.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.300
A new future begins!

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:21.290
By absorbing Team 5D's two Synchro Monsters, 
Meklord Astro Mekanikle has 10300 attack points.

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:24.870
Shooting Star Dragon opposes 
it with 3300 attack points.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.210
Is this the end?

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:28.960
Yusei...

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.890
It's all over.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:38.310
God, please save us!

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:41.210
Yusei Fudo.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.140
I'll finish you!

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:47.600
Meklord Astro Mekanikle 
attacks Shooting Star Dragon!

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:49.030
Yusei!

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.080
I can't afford to lose!

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.260
I activate Guard Master's effect!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:59.720
When you attack when this card is in the 
graveyard, by removing this card from play...

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:05.690
...the attack target switches to defense 
position and isn't destroyed this turn!

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:15.450
We're saved.

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:17.330
You're tough.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:22.350
But I hope you didn't forget about 
Meklord Astro Mekanikle's effect.

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:28.410
During the End Phase, by sending Meklord Astro 
Mekanikle's absorbed Synchro Monster to the graveyard...

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:32.000
...you take damage equal to 
its original attack points.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:39.060
I send Red Nova Dragon to the graveyard 
to deal 3500 points of damage!

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:46.480
Yusei only has 2800 life points!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.320
If he takes this effect, it's over!

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:49.630
Yusei!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.360
I activate the Continuous Trap Hardship!

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:56.070
This card equips on to Shooting Star Dragon.

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:59.980
The equipped monster's attack and defense points become

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:03.660
0, and your monster's effect damage also becomes 0 this turn!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.220
All right, you survived!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:13.190
I send Black-Winged Dragon to the 
graveyard to deal 2800 points of damage!

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.110
What?

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:16.550
Even if you do that, Hardship's effect

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:20.370
negates the damage, and Mekanikle loses attack points.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:27.070
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Hardship's effect again!

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:33.700
No matter how hard you 
try, you can't defeat me.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.760
I activate my trap Infinite Feast.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:42.480
When Synchro Monsters that Meklord Astro 
Mekanikle absorbed are in the graveyard this turn...

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:47.590
...Meklord Astro Mekanikle reabsorbs the 
Synchro Monsters from the graveyard.

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:49.930
Absorb from the graveyard?

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:53.910
What?

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:06.830
Red Nova Dragon will be absorbed again!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:10.110
You take damage equal to the number of Synchro Monsters that

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:14.310
Meklord Astro Mekanikle absorbed multiplied by 600 points this turn!

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:19.700
Meklord Astro Mekanikle absorbed two in the 
beginning and two more during the End Phase.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.220
That's a total of four.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.560
2400 points of damage!

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:26.120
Even though he knew it wouldn't work, he sent

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:30.150
Black-Winged Dragon to the graveyard to increase the amount of damage!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.660
Take this, Yusei Fudo!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.970
Yusei!

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:55.380
Due to Infinite Feast's effect, 
I regain 600 life points.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:01.590
I activate Meklord Astro Mekanikle's effect!

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:06.850
It gains the absorbed Synchro 
Monster's original attack points!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:11.310
It's back to 10300 attack points!

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.120
I end my turn.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:17.540
Yusei Fudo, I'll finish you next turn!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.180
I have 400 life points left.

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:23.520
If I take damage next time, 
I'll definitely lose.

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:25.830
Why are you hesitating, Yusei?

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:29.010
Our bond won't lose against anyone!

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:33.690
That's right!  That bond 
always led us to victory!

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:35.560
Do your best, Yusei!

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:37.160
Yusei...

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:46.820
That's right.  I still have hope.

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:51.380
This draw is the final hope.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:56.310
Cards, hear my voice!

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.000
My...

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:01.630
...turn!

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.280
It's here!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:12.070
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Hardship's effect.

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:15.910
By sending this card to the graveyard, 
the equipped monster is destroyed!

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:20.940
What?  You're destroying 
Shooting Star Dragon?

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:25.160
Then all Equip Cards on 
the field are destroyed!

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:32.380
Red Nova Dragon and Black-Winged Dragon that 
Meklord Astro Mekanikle absorbed are Equip Cards!

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:39.960
All right!  Meklord Astro 
Mekanikle lost attack points!

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.800
But you have no monsters on your field.

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:46.810
That means you can't defeat 
Meklord Astro Mekanikle!

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.040
The battle is only beginning!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.990
I summon Mystic Piper from my hand!

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:58.260
I can release this card to draw one card.

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:01.640
If I draw a monster, I can draw another card!

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:07.350
I drew a monster card!

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:09.390
Therefore, I get to draw another card!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.730
I have assembled hope in my hand!

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:18.500
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Ghoul Summoner!

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:22.200
I Special Summon a Synchro Monster that was destroyed and

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:25.950
sent to the graveyard this turn and equip it with this card.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:28.550
I Special Summon Black-Winged Dragon!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.800
Black-Winged Dragon?

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:39.130
Don't you understand that Synchro Monsters 
don't work against Meklord Astro Mekanikle?

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:43.410
Due to the Continuous Trap 
Ghoul Summoner's effect...

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:48.620
I discard a card from my hand to Special 
Summon a Synchro Monster from my graveyard.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:52.850
But I take damage equal to the 
Synchro Monster's attack points.

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.880
Appear, Red Nova Dragon!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:03.820
You're going to take 3500 points 
of damage and destroy yourself?

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.490
Black-Winged Dragon's effect!

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:12.160
When I take effect damage, I place one Black 
Feather Counter on Black-Winged Dragon.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:19.000
Black-Winged Dragon loses 700 attack points 
per Counter and negates the damage!

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:24.970
I see!  He Special Summoned Black-Winged 
Dragon first to absorb the damage!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:34.210
Red Nova Dragon gains 500 attack points 
for every Tuner in our graveyard.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:38.060
Mono Synchron and Formula 
Synchron are in our graveyard.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:41.110
Therefore, it gains 1000 attack points!

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:44.840
Then due to Ghoul Summoner's effect, I discard a card from my

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.530
hand to Special Summon Shooting Star Dragon from my graveyard!

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:59.590
Black-Winged Dragon absorbs Shooting Star Dragon's

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:03.640
effect damage by putting one Black Feather Counter on it!

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:16.790
They're all together!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:19.020
It's our bond!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.500
This is our hope!

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:30.820
He was in a lot of trouble, but he managed 
to summon three Synchro Monsters.

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:34.450
Is this the power of the Signers?

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.080
Here I go, Aporia!

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:40.650
No matter how much despair you 
give, our hopes will never vanish!

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:10.540
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:15.880
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:21.250
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:21.390 --> 00:22:23.990
Our hearts resonate

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:29.230
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:35.870
We'll find a place for us

00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:42.640
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:42.640 --> 00:22:47.680
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:53.850
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:53.850 --> 00:23:02.430
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:08.030
We will draw it forever
